sequenceDiagram
    participant Guest
    participant Login.jsx
    participant DRF_API
    participant SimpleJWT
    participant localStorage
    Guest->>Login.jsx: Enter username/password
    Login.jsx->>DRF_API: POST /api/users/login/ [API-011]
    DRF_API->>SimpleJWT: Issue access + refresh
    DRF_API->>Login.jsx: 200 user + tokens
    Login.jsx->>localStorage: Store access/refresh/user_id/username
    Login.jsx->>Guest: Dispatch auth-change; redirect
